     <P align=center><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/201804/2018040416533525.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/201804/2018040416533525.jpg" width=800 height=533> </A><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/Article/UploadFiles/201801/2018010514442901.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/Article/UploadFiles/201801/2018010514442992.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/Article/UploadFiles/201801/2018010514442970.jpg"><BR><BR><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/Article/UploadFiles/201801/2018010514442985.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/Article/UploadFiles/201801/2018010514442967.jpg"><BR><BR><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles_2876/Article/UploadFiles/201801/2018010514442994.jpg"><BR><BR></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日下午，中共绍兴市委常委、组织部部长徐晓光，在市委教育工委书记、局长贺晓敏和副书记、副局长赵爱庆等陪同下，来我校调研党建工作。随行的还有市委两新工委副书记、市委组织部组织处处长应尧刚，市人才发展研究中心副主任戴梦喆和市委教育工委委员、市教育局政治处主任舒越红与直属机关党委专职副书记、市教育局政治处副主任、招生办主任朱伟明等。我校朱雯校长、陈银伟书记、陈柏良副校长等陪同调研并汇报了学校的党建工作和办学情况。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">朱雯代表学校对徐晓光一行的到来表示热烈欢迎和诚挚感谢，并简单介绍了学校近期的各项办学情况和取得的成绩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">陈银伟代表中共绍兴一中党委从“突出一条‘实干’主线”、“传承一项‘党管人才’传统”和“做精四项‘突出’工作”等方面全面汇报了学校的党建工作情况及取得的亮丽成绩。特别是</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri>2017</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年，学校党委结合新一中建设与搬迁、全国信息学奥赛承办、</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri>120</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">周年校庆等诸多大事、要事、难事，团结带领广大党员教师发挥先锋模范作用，干在实处、走在前列，为学校的建设与发展作出了党员应有的贡献。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在听取了学校的汇报后，徐晓光指出：绍兴一中是百年名校，今年刚好迎来了</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><FONT face=Calibri>120</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">周年华诞，学校的党建工作一直以来都做得很扎实，也很有成效。绍兴一中的办学业绩特别是以信息学为特色的学科竞赛，是绍兴教育的“金名片”，声名在外。这是学校党委长期以来认真抓实抓好党建工作，团结带领全体师生员工特别是党员教师锐意进取的结果。今天能到一中来，看到、听到学校的各项办学业绩和成就，心里非常高兴，希望绍兴一中不忘初心，牢记使命、砥砺前行，把“学在绍兴”的文章做实做好，不断引领绍兴教育走向更为美好的明天。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">徐晓光表示，省委市委一直以来很重视学校的党建工作，学校要与时俱进，应势而为，创新创造党建工作的方式方法，理论与实践相结合，不断发挥学校党委的政治核心作用；要进一步贯彻落实“党管人才”的基本政策，加大人才队伍建设和师德师风建设的力度，通过培训、进修、引进等，不断提升教师的教书育人水平和能力；要扎实推进“三会一课”“两学一做”和“主题党日”等党建基础工作，不断提升党员教师的理论水平和党性修养，在学校各项建设与发展中“走在前列，干在实处”。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">调研会之前，徐晓光一行参观了我校的校史博物馆。我校悠久的办学历史、丰厚的文化资料、突出的教育业绩等令他印象深刻，心生敬意。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 14pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
